error[E0266]: an 'is not' narrowing inside an '&&' chain
  --> $DIR/narrowing-is-not-chain.nra:12:18
   |
12 |     if (shape is not circle: Circle && ready) {
   |                  ^^^ 'circle' would be bound when the chain is false
   |
   = note: when the chain is false, any of its conjuncts may be the false one, so nothing proves that the type test failed
   = help: make 'x is not circle: T' the whole condition, or test with 'is' and bind in the true branch

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0266`.
